Theme\ulnone\par
Cutthroat evil adventurers are trying to rob a famous dragon's den together; can they get out without incurring the wrath of the dragon with a lot of loot, without getting killed by each other.  Game is all about undercutting each other and trying to get as much treasure as one can.\par
